# Edge cases pinning down behaviour the acceptance test leaves open (see alarm.c header).
### direct-high-to-low
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=10 escalate=0
init 0
s 0 35
s 10 35
s 20 5
s 30 5
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@10:35.000
HIGH
LOW TO_LOW@30:5.000
