FAULT
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@40:25.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@50:inf
FAULT
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@70:25.000
### fault-clear-into-high
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
sf 10 0
s 20 35
---
cfg
NORMAL
FAULT TO_FAULT@10:0.000
HIGH TO_NORMAL@20:35.000 TO_HIGH@20:35.000
